From b05452db9a1a722dfde29657b5022a3af27655e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 01:16:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] ##asm: USSE pseudo syntax + disassembler tests

Pseudo-C rendering for the usse arch (asm.pseudo=true): mov/ALU ->
"a = b op c", fmad -> "a = b * c + d", ba/br -> "goto", ba.savelink ->
"call", predicate prefixes -> "if (pN) ..."; flagged/memory forms pass
through unchanged.

Add test/db/asm/usse: 30 SGX545 microkernel instructions as disassembly
regression tests (all pass via rasm2 -a usse -b 32).
---
